to his side and they immediately try to lift him to get him out. And at that, Kennedy says, he just says very quietly, oh no, don't lift me. And those are the last words he ever says because he passes out. So Kennedy is taken out of the hotel and rushed to the, eventually to the Good Samaritan Hospital. And news flashes around the country. I will just say this. McCarthy is in his hotel room writing his concession speech and his campaign

