manager told me that when the news reached McCarthy that Kennedy had been shot, his first reaction was to say he brought it upon himself. A day goes by, the nation is waiting, people are stunned and shocked by this. But it's not until the 6th at 2 o'clock in the morning that Kennedy's press secretary comes out of the hospital, and again you can see it on YouTube,, absolutely stricken and he says to the waiting reporters that he has died. In fact, he had effectively died. When he was shot like his brother.

